<title>HONG KONG: Guoco in HK$400 mln property deal.</title>
<headline>Guoco in HK$400 mln property deal.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guoco Group Ltd subsidiary Guoco Land Ltd said in Monday it has agreed to buy 500 car parking spaces at South Horizons in the Ap Lei Chau area of Hong Kong island from third party Secan Ltd for HK$400 million.</p>
<p>In a statement, Guoco Land said it had paid HK$40 million to Secan, with the balance to be paid on June 26.</p>
<p>Secan is 50 percent owned by Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Guoco Group shares were down HK$0.40 to HK$40.00 at midday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (8523) 2843 6370</p>
